<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 36.2 percent in the week ended June 6, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages advanced 36.3 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages increased 36.2 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 9.1 percent to 322.4 from 295.6 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index gained 10.3 percent to 206.4 in the latest survey from 187.2 in the previous week  </p>
